---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="TinyCompiler" description="One tiny tensor program, compiled to two real chips.">
  <main>
    <h1>TinyCompiler</h1>
    <p>
      One tiny tensor language (<code>C = relu(A @ B)</code>) compiled to
      <a href="https://github.com/deaneeth/tiny-gpu">tiny-gpu</a> SIMT kernels and to a
      <a href="https://github.com/deaneeth/tiny-tpu">tiny-tpu</a> tile schedule, and run on the
      real simulator and RTL, bit-exact against numpy.
    </p>
    <p><a href="/app">Open the Compiler Explorer</a></p>
  </main>
</Base>
